sequenceDiagram
    actor You
    participant Bot as Telegram or CLI entry
    participant Runs as Task run store
    participant Orch as Hub orchestrator
    participant Ctx as Canonical project context
    participant Mem as Bounded Hub memory
    participant Reg as Specialist manifests
    participant Res as Project resources
    participant Agent as Selected specialist

    You->>Bot: operator request
    Bot->>Orch: forward message
    Orch->>Ctx: resolve request project against known canonical metadata
    Ctx-->>Orch: one canonical target, current /project fallback, or safe error

    Note over Orch,Mem: bounded context lookup, not new learning
    Orch->>Mem: load relevant preferences
    Mem-->>Orch: active preference records

    Orch->>Reg: load specialist manifests
    Reg-->>Orch: advertised task kinds and contracts

    Orch->>Orch: classify advertised task kind
    Orch->>Orch: deterministically filter eligible specialists
    Orch->>Res: resolve required resources for canonical target project
    Res-->>Orch: exact resource, no match, or safe ambiguity error
    Note over Orch,Res: backlog reference = stored source + exact item ID from request
    Orch->>Runs: transition routed
    Orch->>Agent: dispatch bounded task envelope<br/>only advertised resource fields included
    Orch->>Runs: transition dispatched -> in_progress

    loop progress and pause-resume as needed
        Agent-->>Orch: bounded progress or pause state
        Orch->>Runs: persist progress / pause state
    end
    Agent-->>Orch: structured result
    Orch->>Runs: finalize succeeded or paused state
    Orch-->>Bot: operator-facing response
    Bot-->>You: result, question, or approval prompt

    opt explicit governed teaching
        You->>Bot: /learn operational resource fact
        Bot->>Orch: store memory and validate promotion
        Orch->>Res: upsert resource with provenance
    end
